This is a placeholder file.

To enable audio playback in the SoundSanctuary feature:
1. Download a soothing audio file (rain, ocean, white noise, etc.)
2. Rename it to: rain_loop.mp3
3. Replace this placeholder file with the actual audio file

The app will compile and run without the audio file, but playback will not work.
See README.md in this directory for more information.
